{"name": "Gridlords", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Construct your fortress, master unique synergies, and lead your army to glory in epic asynchronous battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LEAD YOUR RACE AND CHOOSE A HERO\u00a0</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"61\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/209ed704cdaea2a5e343cde498a137ab.webp?t=1781351595\" width=\"519\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick your favorite race and a powerful hero to define your strategy. Each hero brings unique abilities and a personal philosophy, shaping how your army fights and survives. Will you charge with relentless aggression or stand firm with impenetrable defenses? The choice is yours.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD YOUR CASTLE\u00a0</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"61\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/9f416b22cc2af50ce31262b1e33d56b5.webp?t=1781351595\" width=\"519\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your castle is the heart of your strategy. Place buildings, unlock powerful units, and upgrade your fortress to dominate the battlefield. Develop unique tactics by combining unit types, experimenting with synergies, maximize your castle\u2019s strengths and reduce it\u2019s weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/3f484e7dc62f378d3e93bf46ba618891.poster.avif?t=1781351595\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/3f484e7dc62f378d3e93bf46ba618891.webm?t=1781351595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/3f484e7dc62f378d3e93bf46ba618891.mp4?t=1781351595\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIGHT THE OTHERS\u00a0\u00a0 </strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"61\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/fed6a085e65568bba0d3a660ea369140.webp?t=1781351595\" width=\"519\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Test your strategy in asynchronous PvP battles against players from around the world. Deploy your forces and let the auto-battler system determine the victor, skillful planning wins the day. Create the strongest castle, climb the ranks, and prove your dominance in the Gridlords ranked matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/e77e284b399fbc884833dd0fb2f89f75.poster.avif?t=1781351595\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/e77e284b399fbc884833dd0fb2f89f75.webm?t=1781351595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/e77e284b399fbc884833dd0fb2f89f75.mp4?t=1781351595\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>KEY FEATURES\u00a0</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"61\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/9902d3998607814676620857dc0b995e.webp?t=1781351595\" width=\"519\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Castle Building</strong> \u2013 Design and expand your fortress for maximum advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Asynchronous PvP Battles</strong> \u2013 Test your strategy against other players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Legendary Races &amp; Heroes</strong> \u2013 Select races and champions that shape your tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Deep Synergies</strong> \u2013 Combine units and abilities for powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fantasy Pixel-Art</strong> \u2013 A nostalgic yet fresh aesthetic with detailed visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/d121008b1a4abe6790dc1e939bd16d20.poster.avif?t=1781351595\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/d121008b1a4abe6790dc1e939bd16d20.webm?t=1781351595\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/extras/d121008b1a4abe6790dc1e939bd16d20.mp4?t=1781351595\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Gridlords is a strategic async-PvP autobattler set in a fantasy pixel-art world. Build your ultimate castle, command legendary heroes, and outsmart rivals to prove your strategy reigns supreme.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768400/e99f056200b59542a85371ae530cb6f921c06a28/header.jpg?t=1781351595", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Auto Battler", "Turn-Based Ta